{
  "An on / off switch with its caption: a track with a thumb that slides, an optional on / off text inside or next to it, read-only and required. A native checkbox with the switch role underneath.": "",
  "On / off text": "",
  "`onText` and `offText` show in the track (the track grows to fit them) or next to it. The texts are for the eye; the switch says its state itself.": "",
  "The caption sits after the track, or before it with `labelPosition=\"start\"`; with `stretch` the field takes the width and the track goes to the far end, as in a settings list.": "",
  "Flips it (the native key).": "",
  "Flips it too, as on a button.": "",
  "Focuses and flips it (Control + Option + key on Apple platforms).": "",
  "A native `<input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"switch\">`: screen readers say \"switch, on / off\"; the browser gives it Space, the form value, `:checked` and `:disabled`, and its caption is a `<label for>`, so a click on the caption flips it.": "",
  "Drawn for the eye only (`aria-hidden`): the state is read out from the switch itself.": "",
  "The thumb slides with the motion tokens; it stops sliding when the user asks for reduced motion.": "",
  "The design system focus ring around the track, for the keyboard only.": "",
  "The switch writes no text of its own: `onText` and `offText` are yours, and can be functions of your own language state. The `required` message comes from `uiLocale.strings`.": "",
  "The field. `data-state` (`checked`, `unchecked`), `data-state-text`, `data-label-position`, `data-size`, `data-invalid`, `data-readonly`, `data-disabled`.": "",
  "The layout CheckBox and Switch share.": "",
  "The native checkbox: the track itself.": "",
  "The thumb drawn over the track.": "",
  "The on / off texts.": "",
  "Units: the track and the thumb, each with every state (`checked`, `invalid`, `hover`, `pressed`, `focus`, `disabled` and their pairs).": "",
  "Units: an icon in the thumb and a halo around it, where the language has them.": "",
  "Units: the on / off text in the track and beside it.": "",
  "The track, per size.": "",
  "The thumb per size and state, the space around it, and how far it stretches while pressed.": "",
  "The space of the on / off text, and before the caption.": "",
  "On or off. `x-model` binds it two-way.": "",
  "The caption next to the track; `&Name` makes Alt+N flip it. The same property as `text`.": "",
  "The caption after the track (`end`) or before it (`start`), in the reading direction.": "",
  "`hidden` keeps the caption for screen readers only; every other mode shows it next to the track.": "",
  "A short text for each state, e.g. `On` / `Off`.": "",
  "Where that text shows: `inside` the track, `beside` it, or `none`.": "",
  "Focusable and read out, but it does not flip.": "",
  "It must be on.": "",
  "Fills the width; with `labelPosition=\"start\"` the track goes to the far end.": "",
  "The native `<input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"switch\">`.": "",
  "Flips it as a click does.": "",
  "Focuses the switch.": ""
}
